    {
      "text": "Extracted image fragment from the back cover's contact-information text, rendered as a solid rectangular block of WHO blue with no discernible letterform. It corresponds to a character or word from the heading text (e.g. 'Department of Reproductive Health and Research', 'World Health Organization') rather than to a distinct pictorial element; legible content could not be determined from the extracted image.",
